sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant R as RedirectController
  participant S as UrlService
  participant Ca as Cache (Redis / in-mem)
  participant DB as Database
  participant P as IEventPublisher
  participant K as Kafka / Channel
  participant Co as Click Consumer

  C->>R: GET /{code}
  R->>S: ResolveAsync(code)
  S->>Ca: get code
  alt cache hit
    Ca-->>S: target + expiry
  else cache miss
    S->>DB: lookup by code
    DB-->>S: row (or none)
    S->>Ca: set (ttl = min 1h, time-to-expiry)
  end
  alt found & not expired
    S-->>R: Found(target)
    R-->>C: 302 Found
    R-)P: publish UrlClicked (fire-and-forget)
    P-)K: enqueue event
    K-)Co: deliver
    Co->>DB: insert ClickEvent (off hot path)
  else expired
    S-->>R: Expired
    R-->>C: 410 Gone
  else unknown
    S-->>R: NotFound
    R-->>C: 404 Not Found
  end
